WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.502
"Tor!" Sara called.

2
00:00:15.503 --> 00:00:24.385
"Where did she go?"

3
00:00:24.386 --> 00:00:32.906
Rex looked around.

4
00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:38.676
"I see Tor," he said.

5
00:00:38.677 --> 00:00:42.496
"She ran to the vines."

6
00:00:42.497 --> 00:00:55.649
The buddies ran to Tor.

7
00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.151
Rex picked up a vine.

8
00:00:58.152 --> 00:01:04.480
The vine was tied to a tree.

9
00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:06.591
Rex turned his arm.

10
00:01:06.592 --> 00:01:09.987
The vine swung around and around.

11
00:01:09.988 --> 00:01:11.932
Rex smiled.

12
00:01:11.933 --> 00:01:15.483
"Now someone can jump the vine!"

13
00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:18.096
"Yay!" Sara said.

14
00:01:18.097 --> 00:01:20.520
"Cool!" Tor said.

15
00:01:20.521 --> 00:01:23.385
Sara and Tor jumped.

16
00:01:23.386 --> 00:01:26.115
Bam!

17
00:01:26.116 --> 00:01:28.366
"Oof!" Sara said.

18
00:01:28.367 --> 00:01:31.441
"Ouch!" Tor said.

19
00:01:31.442 --> 00:01:37.646
"One dino at a time," Rex said.

20
00:01:37.647 --> 00:01:40.890
This time Sara went first.

21
00:01:40.891 --> 00:01:46.158
She giggled. "Fun!"

22
00:01:46.159 --> 00:01:49.266
Next, Tor jumped the vine.

23
00:01:49.267 --> 00:01:55.227
"Whee!" Tor laughed.

24
00:01:55.228 --> 00:01:59.243
"Your turn, Sid," Rex said.

25
00:01:59.244 --> 00:02:02.536
"Here I go!" Sid said.

26
00:02:02.537 --> 00:02:04.048
He jumped.

27
00:02:04.049 --> 00:02:08.096
His tail swung.

28
00:02:08.097 --> 00:02:12.247
"Uh-oh!" Sid said.

29
00:02:12.248 --> 00:02:18.442
"The vine is tangled in my spikes!"

